        <item>
            <title>2.8.3</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 14:59:50 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>71</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.8.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Changes

- Plugging in headphones or getting a Teams notification no longer starts a recording.
- A Teams call that Ahoy recorded automatically now stops about 10 seconds after you hang up, instead of recording on.
- An automatic recording now starts once a call app has used the microphone for about 3 seconds, so a short sound never starts one. The first few seconds of a detected call are not recorded.
- FaceTime calls are no longer detected automatically. Start those with Start Recording.
]]></description>
