            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Changes

- While a summary waits for a transcription on this Mac to finish, the Insights card says so instead of "Generating…".
- A summary that resumes on its own after Low Power Mode, heat or memory pressure can no longer be slowed by App Nap while the window is closed.
]]></description>
